text ...Sanae-san.
text @[Tomoya]
text What about Sanae-san. Is she back?
text She shakes her head no.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh. Don't get my hopes up like that.
sound P01.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Sanae-san.
text She repeats the word again.
text Must mean that she's asking me a question.
text @[Tomoya]
text If she's not here, that means she hasn't come back yet. Can't you at least figure that much out?
sound P02.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Gone for a lot longer?
text @[Tomoya]
text That's exactly what I'd like to know.
text @[Tomoya]
text She'll be back in the evening at the earliest. Just hope and wait.
sound P03.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I'm hungry.
text Her declaration makes me realize that neither of us have had lunch.
text @[Tomoya]
text Tsk...
text @[Tomoya]
text There has to at least be some bread left, right...?
