text It's hot.
text I can practically feel the sun working its way through and burning my skin.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I don't care what it is, the ocean or a lake... I just feel like jumping in some water...)
text I start to walk.
text There should be a small corner supermarket a little bit ahead of here.
text But that was a while ago; there's no telling if it's still open.
text Or maybe it's turned into a giant supermarket instead, who knows.
text @[Tomoya]
text But if there's one place I wish would stay the same, this neighborhood would be it...
sound P07.aac
text @[Housewife]
text Oh, it's nice to see you again.
text A passing housewife stops her bicycle and looks in my direction.
text When I look at her, I recognize her as a regular customer from when I worked at Furukawa Bread.
text @[Tomoya]
text 'Sup.
sound P08.aac
