text ...But...
sound P2D.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...She said there's a place where it's okay to cry...
text @[Tomoya]
text Where it's okay to cry?
sound P2E.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Where's that?
sound P2F.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...The potty.
text So that's why she took it upon herself to run over to a train bathroom she'd never even been in before.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, yeah, you can cry in a bathroom without anyone else knowing, but...
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you always crying in the bathroom?
sound P2G.aac
text @[Ushio]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text But what if you're outside...
sound P2H.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Hold it in.
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you being serious?
sound P2I.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yes.
text @[Tomoya]
text But... doesn't that make you feel even sadder?
text I don't understand why Sanae-san is teaching her such things.
text @[Tomoya]
text I think it's all right for you to cry when you feel like crying.
text @[Tomoya]
text Once you get bigger, there are gonna be a lot of times where you have to hold it in even though you feel like crying.
text @[Tomoya]
text So you should cry while you still have the chance.
