text Ushio is holding a stumpy robot the size of her palm.
text Its design was amusingly behind the times, so I ended up suggesting it to her before I realized what I was doing.
text Ushio immediately decided on the toy.
text But when I step back and think about it, who would really want it? Not even a boy, let alone a girl.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Maybe it's some kind of reproduction model for nerds...?)
