text I see Ushio the entire time.
text She's sitting still, staring at the passing scenery.
text She's pressing the robot in her hands to the window.
text I wonder if she's having fun on her summer vacation...
text So much fun that she'll be able to brag to her friends about it...
text I suppose there's no way she'd be having fun when she's alone with her scary dad...
text It's our first trip together, but...
text Ushio seems lonely. She's by herself, and all she has is the scenery.
text .........
