text The sun is already starting to set by the time we reach the first day's destination.
text I check the name of the station against Sanae-san's notes.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, this is it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's go, Ushio.
text We pass through the ticket gates and find ourselves in an unknown land.
text I look down at Sanae-san's notes.
text ..."Use the bus to go to the zoo, then head to our room for the night."
text @[Tomoya]
text The zoo, huh...
text @[Tomoya]
text We're going to wait here for a bus, Ushio.
text The two of us line up in front of the bus stop.
text ......
text We wait a while, but the bus still doesn't show.
text I check the timetable.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Gah... One an hour...?)
text @[Tomoya]
text (If we took a taxi, we wouldn't have any money left for the train ride home...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Wait, do we even have enough time...?)
text Sanae-san's notes have us arriving at our hotel at 6 pm.
text We have a reservation, so we should be able to delay our check-in as long as I contact them first.
text ...Hold on.
text @[Tomoya]
text (We're one day behind schedule, aren't we...)
text @[Tomoya]
text Ushio...
sound P2X.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Hm?
text @[Tomoya]
text We can go to the zoo next time.
sound P2Y.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...What?
text @[Tomoya]
text We don't have time. We have to find somewhere to stay the night too.
sound P2Z.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...
text She looks like she's about to cry.
text @[Tomoya]
text I have to do this for a bunch of reasons. Can't you figure that much out?
text @[Tomoya]
text And anyway, there are zoos everywhere. You don't have to come out here to the middle of nowhere just to go to a zoo, you know.
sound P30.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...She said you can touch them here.
text @[Tomoya]
text The animals?
sound P31.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Yeah. I wanted to touch them.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh...
text @[Tomoya]
text Or do you want to change our plans and go to the zoo tomorrow?
text @[Tomoya]
text We won't be able to go to this Cape Something-or-other if we do, but...
sound P32.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...I want to go there too.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well make up your mind.
text @[Tomoya]
text This one, uhh... has a field of flowers.
text @[Tomoya]
text Wouldn't you rather go to the zoo?
sound P33.aac
text @[Ushio]
text Flowers...
text @[Tomoya]
text So you like flowers better? At least that's girly of you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, then let's head to the hotel for tonight.
text @[Tomoya]
text I wonder if this place still has rooms open...
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's go.
sound P34.aac
text @[Ushio]
text ...Okay.
