text She probably doesn't understand what I just said. She looks anxious.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll hold your bag, so walk a little faster.
text No matter how much I try to hurry her along, her feet continue to be unsteady and meandering.
text Is this her idea of running?
text It would be faster if she just walked normally.
text @[Tomoya]
text (What're we going to do if everywhere is full...?)
text I don't have anyone to lay the blame on, either.
text So this is how limited you are when you have to do something with a kid...
