text By the time 9 comes around, we finally are able to settle down in a room at a small inn.
text But since I don't have enough cash on hand, I'll need to wake up early the next morning to find a bank.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I can't believe how much work this is...)
text I don't feel like doing anything after getting out of the bath, and I go straight to sleep.
text The last thing I see before dozing off is Ushio's profile as she stares, engrossed, at the television.
